<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="L_5_8-ZZMfSFAngP2pZS">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3041" dy="2368" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Marketing Module &amp; Campaign Execution (SRS 3.2.6)\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\nskinparam roundcorner 18\n\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\nskinparam packageBorderColor #647F99\nskinparam packageFontColor #263B50\nskinparam packagePadding 16\nskinparam packageMargin 12\n\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 13\nskinparam nodesep 30\nskinparam ranksep 45\n\n&#39; أمر الخطوط الحادة \nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.4\n\nskinparam UseCaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam UseCaseBorderColor #647F99\nskinparam UseCaseFontColor #263B50\n\nskinparam ActorBorderColor #334155\nskinparam ActorFontColor #263B50\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Primary Actors (على الشمال)\n&#39; =========================\nactor \&quot;Marketing Manager\&quot; as Manager #DCEBFA\nactor \&quot;Content Creator (CC)\&quot; as CC #FEF08A\nactor \&quot;Graphic Designer\&quot; as Designer #FDE047\nactor \&quot;Media Buyer\&quot; as MediaBuyer #FACC15\n\nrectangle \&quot;Marketing Module\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; Column 1\n    together {\n        package \&quot;01 - Doctor Profile &amp; Segmentation (3.2.6.1)\&quot; as P1 {\n            usecase \&quot;View Existing Doctor\\nClassifications\&quot; as UC01\n            usecase \&quot;Assign Doctor Weights\&quot; as UC02\n            usecase \&quot;Assign Zone Weights\&quot; as UC03\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;02 - AI Marketing Plan Analysis (3.2.6.2)\&quot; as P2 {\n            usecase \&quot;Provide Marketing Plan\&quot; as UC04_Plan\n            usecase \&quot;Upload IMS Market Data\\n(Optional)\&quot; as UC04_IMS\n            usecase \&quot;Analyze Marketing Plan\&quot; as UC05\n            usecase \&quot;Suggest Improvements &amp;\\nGenerate Campaign Ideas\&quot; as UC06\n            usecase \&quot;Review AI Suggestions\&quot; as UC06_Review\n        }\n    }\n\n    &#39; Column 2\n    together {\n        package \&quot;03 - Sequential Marketing Workflow (3.2.6.3)\&quot; as P3 {\n            usecase \&quot;Approve Campaign Plan\&quot; as UC07\n            usecase \&quot;Execute Content &amp;\\nCopywriting\&quot; as UC08\n            usecase \&quot;Create and Upload\\nVisual Designs\&quot; as UC09\n            usecase \&quot;Publish and Manage\\nAd Campaigns\&quot; as UC10\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;04 - Campaign Performance &amp; Reports (3.2.6.4)\&quot; as P4 {\n            usecase \&quot;Retrieve Campaign\\nAdvertising Data\&quot; as UC11\n            usecase \&quot;Compare Ad Expenses\\nwith Sales Revenue\&quot; as UC12\n            usecase \&quot;Evaluate Campaign\\nPerformance &amp; ROI\&quot; as UC13\n            usecase \&quot;Review Reports &amp; High-Level\\nBusiness KPI Dashboards\&quot; as UC14\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Secondary Actors (على اليمين)\n&#39; =========================\nactor \&quot;AI Service\&quot; as AI #F3E8FF\nactor \&quot;Meta Business Suite API\&quot; as Meta #FFE4E6\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Layout Hints\n&#39; =========================\nUC01 -[hidden]-&gt; UC07\nUC04_Plan -[hidden]-&gt; UC11\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Marketing Manager - BLUE\n&#39; =========================\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC01\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC02\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC03\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC14\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC04_Plan\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC04_IMS\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC06_Review\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC07\n\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC12\nManager -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC13\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Execution Team - ORANGE/YELLOW\n&#39; =========================\nCC -[#CA8A04]-&gt; UC08\nDesigner -[#CA8A04]-&gt; UC09\nMediaBuyer -[#CA8A04]-&gt; UC10\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Executive Leadership - GREEN\n&#39; =========================\n\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; AI Service &amp; Meta API (Right to Left)\n&#39; =========================\nUC05 &lt;-[#9333EA]- AI\nUC06 &lt;-[#9333EA]- AI\n\nUC11 &lt;-[#E11D48]- Meta\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Relationships (Includes/Extends)\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; SRS 3.2.6.2 Logic\nUC04_Plan ..&gt; UC05 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 &lt;.. UC04_IMS : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC06 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC06_Review ..&gt; UC06 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Performance Logic\nUC12 ..&gt; UC11 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC13 ..&gt; UC12 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; SRS Notes\n&#39; =========================\nnote bottom of P2\n  **SRS 3.2.6.2:** Manager provides the Marketing Plan \n  and optionally uploads IMS Data. The AI Service \n  analyzes the plan and generates suggestions.\n  Manager then reviews the AI suggestions.\nend note\n\nnote right of P3\n  **SRS 3.2.6.3:** The system routes tasks \n  sequentially strictly as follows:\n  1. Manager Approves Plan\n  2. Content Creator (Copywriting)\n  3. Graphic Designer (Visuals)\n  4. Media Buyer (Publish Ads)\n  (Modeled as separate Use Cases; sequence enforced by system logic).\nend note\n\nnote bottom of P4\n  **SRS 3.2.6.4:** Authorized users compare\n  API advertising expenses with recorded sales \n  revenue to evaluate ROI.\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2fF-lEA91yrzz8nCXIr7-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
