        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;SRS 3.2.6.3:&lt;/b&gt; The system routes tasks&lt;br&gt;sequentially strictly as follows:&lt;br&gt;1. Manager Approves Plan&lt;br&gt;2. Content Creator (Copywriting)&lt;br&gt;3. Graphic Designer (Visuals)&lt;br&gt;4. Media Buyer (Publish Ads)&lt;br&gt;(Modeled as separate Use Cases; sequence enforced by system logic)." plantUmlId="note_56" plantUmlBaseStyle="shape=note;size=10;fillColor=#FEFFDD;strokeColor=#181818;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=4;rounded=1;arcSize=18;absoluteArcSize=1;shadow=0;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;" plantUmlBaseValue="&lt;b&gt;SRS 3.2.6.3:&lt;/b&gt; The system routes tasks&lt;br&gt;sequentially strictly as follows:&lt;br&gt;1. Manager Approves Plan&lt;br&gt;2. Content Creator (Copywriting)&lt;br&gt;3. Graphic Designer (Visuals)&lt;br&gt;4. Media Buyer (Publish Ads)&lt;br&gt;(Modeled as separate Use Cases; sequence enforced by system logic)." id="2fF-lEA91yrzz8nCXIr7-58">
